                    {
                        "sense_id": "4786fc94-f6f9-3796-945c-7c5788e8ad91",
                        "entry_id": "264c53c0-181f-398d-9a32-6c2bb53fe330",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Semy of plates (roundels argent)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15bf6d16-f5f7-42eb-9141-ad267d3f40de",
                                "sense_id": "4786fc94-f6f9-3796-945c-7c5788e8ad91",
                                "text": "Alternative form: platé"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d53be159-123e-4d41-b765-d235db75741e",
                                "sense_id": "4786fc94-f6f9-3796-945c-7c5788e8ad91",
                                "text": "Gules, a saltire argent within a bordure sable bezantée (sic C., but Papworth cites, p. 1069, from A., per saltire gules and sable, a saltire argent, and a bordure of the 2nd platy)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c245bcd3-99e3-4aca-bd7b-c7b0ec5e359e",
                                "sense_id": "4786fc94-f6f9-3796-945c-7c5788e8ad91",
                                "text": "[...] fretty gules besanty / here the besants are placed at the intersection of the pieces of the fretty. A similar coat, Or, fretty gules platy, is an old coat of VERDON; and Or, fretty sable platy is the canting coat of PLATT."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fda97156-7561-4fa2-8d38-228f8f114453",
                                "sense_id": "4786fc94-f6f9-3796-945c-7c5788e8ad91",
                                "text": "Or, a fess dancetty of two points gules masoned argent; on a chief azure a representation of Maidenhead Bridge over water barry wavy in base. 212. Argent, a fess gules between 3 astral crowns azure. 213. Sable platy, a pile barry[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3618a45-5975-4899-90e8-892c3e27212a",
                                "sense_id": "4786fc94-f6f9-3796-945c-7c5788e8ad91",
                                "text": "Sable platy, two flaunches argent - Spelman (159). Gules, five lozenges conjoined in bend argent - Raleigh (160)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
